ransform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"849\" y=\"513\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"1276\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E16-MJMAIN-32\" x=\"2277\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> in terms of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.877ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 808 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-17-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-17-Title\">a,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E17-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E17-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E17-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E17-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"529\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> we obtain the following:\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"30.926ex\" height=\"21.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -10.171ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -4881.6 13315.2 9260.9\" role=\"